      "formula": "φ(M_1500,z) = (ln10/2.5) · φ*(z) · 10^{0.4(α+1)(M*−M_1500)} · exp(−10^{0.4(M*−M_1500)})；φ*(z), M*(z), α(z) ← ρ̇*(z) = f* · f_coll(M_min(T_vir^min), z) · ρ̄_b；L_1500 = κ_UV Ṁ*(M_halo)，M_1500 = −2.5 log10(L_1500/L_28)",
