          "map_mass.h",
          "photoncons.h",
          "bubble_helper_progs.h",
          "recombinations.h",
          "LuminosityFunction.h"
        ],
        "codeAnchor": {
          "kind": "files",
          "files": [
            "cosmology.h",
            "hmf.h",
            "interp_tables.h",
            "dft.h",
            "thermochem.h",
            "filtering.h",
            "scaling_relations.h",
            "fdm.h",
            "Stochasticity.h",
            "elec_interp.h",
            "heating_helper_progs.h",
            "map_mass.h",
            "photoncons.h",
            "bubble_helper_progs.h",
            "recombinations.h",
            "LuminosityFunction.h"
          ]
        },
        "note": "共享内核层：被多个 .c 一起 #include 的公共头文件，按引用它的 .c 个数排序（cosmology.h 21、hmf.h 11、interp_tables.h 11、dft.h 8、thermochem.h 8、filtering.h 7、scaling_relations.h 5、fdm.h 4、heating_helper_progs.h 3、map_mass.h 3、Stochasticity.h 3、photoncons.h 3、elec_interp.h 3、recombinations.h 2、bubble_helper_progs.h 2、LuminosityFunction.h 1）。层的成员是**文件**不是物理量，所以不计入 28 个对象。fdm.h 是本 fork 自带（上游 v4.1.1 无此文件），横切「宇宙学背景与物质功率谱」与「晕目录与质量函数」"
      },
      {
        "id": "block:cosmo",
